{
  "raw": {
    "https://careers.must.edu.mo/recruitment-latest-details?0=693&from=RecruitmentLatest": {
      "title": "Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor - 澳門材料科學與工程研究院(MIMSE)",
      "description": "Department: 澳門材料科學與工程研究院(MIMSE) Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor 職位編碼 20260701021 招聘部門 澳門材料科學與工程研究院(MIMSE) 招聘地點 澳門_中國 招聘時間 2026/07/01 ~ 直至空缺被填補 職位描述 Macau University of Science and Technology inaugurated the “Macao Institute of materials science and engineering (MIMSE)” in January 2021 under the leadership of Prof. Shuit-Tong Lee, an academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and The Academy of Sciences for the Developing World. MIMSE is mainly oriented to the fields of artificial intelligence, advanced manufacturing, biomedicine and big health, with advanced functional materials as the core, focusing on the frontier cross-disciplinary innovation of information display, organic optoelectronics, flexible electronics, wearable intelligent sensing, biomedical materials, functional surface and interface, materials genome, etc. MIMSE is currently seeking outstanding candidates to fill Principal Investigator positions at all Ranks (Professor/Associate Professor/Assistant Professor). Applicants in all areas of nano science and technology are of interest, including, but not limited to: • Functional nanomaterials and devices; • Organic optoelectronic materials and devices; • Optical science and engineering; • Surface and interface science; • Nanotechnology for biological and biomedical applications; • Novel characterization techniques and instrumentations; • Materials simulation, artificial intelligence, and material design. Qualifications: • A PhD or equivalent degree in physics, chemistry, materials science and engineering, biology, bioengineering, electronic and electrical engineering, or other relevant disciplines; • Outstanding science or engineering background and exceptional research accomplishment; • Ability to conduct innovative and collaborative research with a unique research focus. • Capable of teaching in English. Remuneration Package： • Highly competitive pay and benefit package (on a case-by-case basis) including basic salary, housing allowance, and additional bonuses based on scientific/teaching achievements; • Startup laboratory and equipment/operation fund as per research needs. Application Procedure： Applicants should submit an online application and attach documents containing a letter of application, curriculum vitae, as well as a research plan, a proposed budget, and a teaching statement as required. Applicants should also arrange for three letters of recommendation. Review of applicants will begin immediately upon receipt of complete application materials. 立即申請 科大概況 澳門科技大學建校於 2000 年，發展迅速，已成為澳門在校學生規模最大的綜合型大學。位列英國《泰晤士高等教育》世界排名 300 強及世界年輕大學排名 38 位（ 2024 年）。大學致力為社會培養各類高質素人才，推行教研並重政策，注重辦學特色，追求卓越。澳門科技大學成為了澳門第一所成功全面通過英國高等教育品質保障局（ Quality Assurance Agency for Higher Education ， QAA ）高等教育素質評鑒 - 院校認證（ Institutional Accreditation ）的高校。大學坐落澳門氹仔島，環境優美，交通便利，是學子求學及從事研究的理想之地。 經過多年建設，大學現有五個國家級研究平台：中藥機制與質量全國重點實驗室、月球與行星科學全國重點實驗室、中國歷史研究院澳門歷史研究中心、澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站和中國 - 葡萄牙人工智能與公共衛生問題「一帶一路」聯合實驗室。此外還建立了二十多個重大的研究院所及研究中心，在多個領域開展了戰略性跨學科及前沿研究。 展望未來，澳門科技大學將繼續以教研為本，廣納賢才，實現辦學宗旨和教育使命。 Copyright © 2023-2026 澳門科技大學 版權所有 系統檢測到您已申請過此職位，不可再次投遞，請選擇其他職位進行申請 關閉"
    },
    "https://careers.must.edu.mo/recruitment-latest-details?0=694&from=RecruitmentLatest": {
      "title": "Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor - 澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站，水利部數字孿生流域重點實驗室",
      "description": "Department: 澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站，水利部數字孿生流域重點實驗室 Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor 職位編碼 20260701022 招聘部門 澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站，水利部數字孿生流域重點實驗室 招聘地點 澳門_中國 招聘時間 2026/07/01 ~ 直至空缺被填補 職位描述 National Observation and Research Station of Coastal Ecological Environments in Macao (NORSCEM), as the only national-level field scientific observation and research station approved outside of mainland, China, aims to support the response to climate change, sea-level rise, storm surges, coastal zone degradation, eutrophication and other eco-environmental issues. A key mission is to enhance coastal resilience in the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area (GBA) by building an integrated sky-land-sea observation and scientific research platform, utilizing advanced technologies, such as remote sensing, artificial intelligence, and automatic in-situ and on-line monitoring, and digital twins incorporating 3D numerical modeling. The Key Laboratory of River Basin Digital Twinning of Ministry of Water Resources (DTL) was jointly developed by the China Institute of Water Resources and Hydropower Research (IWHR) in Beijing and M.U.S.T. and launched in 2023. The laboratory aims to conduct forward-looking inter-disciplinary research in the field of smart water management. Both NORSCEM and DTL also serve as an important initiative to implement the national strategy of the Greater Bay Area (GBA) and to promote the integration of Macao’s scientific and technological development into the national innovation system. Currently, NORSCEM and DTL have strong research programs with support from different sponsors, such as Macao Science and Technology Development Fund (FDCT) and National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC). NORSCEM and DTL are also closely linked with research, innovation and teaching in the Faculty of Innovation Engineering (FIE). More information for NORSCEM and FIE can be found by the weblinks: https://ceem.must.edu.mo or https://fie.must.edu.mo. In line with our development plan, applicants who have achieved outstanding academic achievements in the following or related areas are cordially invited to apply. Professional Areas Digital Twin Technology, Coastal and Estuarine Science/Engineering, Smart Water Management, AI Applications, Environmental Informatics and Modeling, Eco-hydraulics and hydrology, IOT and Lab on Chip Monitoring Technology, Remote Sensing, Atmospheric Chemistry, eco-restoration. Candidates with interdisciplinary research experience and strong domain expertise are particularly welcome. Qualifications - An earned Doctorate Degree in related discipline. - Bilingual teaching ability preferred. - Strong research record (overseas experience would be an advantage) - Proven university teaching experience would be preferred but not essential. Remuneration Package Remuneration and appointment rank offered will be commensurate with the successful applicants’ academic qualification, professional experience and current position. Medical benefits, annual leave, provident fund, allowance and bonus, on job training program or overseas study opportunities will be provided by the University. Application Procedure Applicants should submit an online application and attach documents as required. 立即申請 科大概況 澳門科技大學建校於 2000 年，發展迅速，已成為澳門在校學生規模最大的綜合型大學。位列英國《泰晤士高等教育》世界排名 300 強及世界年輕大學排名 38 位（ 2024 年）。大學致力為社會培養各類高質素人才，推行教研並重政策，注重辦學特色，追求卓越。澳門科技大學成為了澳門第一所成功全面通過英國高等教育品質保障局（ Quality Assurance Agency for Higher Education ， QAA ）高等教育素質評鑒 - 院校認證（ Institutional Accreditation ）的高校。大學坐落澳門氹仔島，環境優美，交通便利，是學子求學及從事研究的理想之地。 經過多年建設，大學現有五個國家級研究平台：中藥機制與質量全國重點實驗室、月球與行星科學全國重點實驗室、中國歷史研究院澳門歷史研究中心、澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站和中國 - 葡萄牙人工智能與公共衛生問題「一帶一路」聯合實驗室。此外還建立了二十多個重大的研究院所及研究中心，在多個領域開展了戰略性跨學科及前沿研究。 展望未來，澳門科技大學將繼續以教研為本，廣納賢才，實現辦學宗旨和教育使命。 Copyright © 2023-2026 澳門科技大學 版權所有 系統檢測到您已申請過此職位，不可再次投遞，請選擇其他職位進行申請 關閉"
    },
    "https://careers.must.edu.mo/recruitment-latest-details?0=695&from=RecruitmentLatest": {
      "title": "Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor - 工程科學系(DES)",
      "description": "Department: 工程科學系(DES) Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor 職位編碼 20260701023 招聘部門 工程科學系(DES) 招聘地點 澳門_中國 招聘時間 2026/07/01 ~ 直至空缺被填補 職位描述 The Department of Engineering Science is composed of international high-level researchers from broad disciplines. It is developing to become a first-class research and education institute in the Greater Bay Area, to produce innovative talents in intelligent production, intelligent robotics, digital twin systems, biotechnology, and management engineering. To cope with our developmental plan, applications are invited from those with excellent academic achievements in the following areas: Professional Areas Applied mathematics and data science, Intelligent systems engineering, Biotechnology, integrated simulation, Management engineering,and Low-altitude Economy and Technology. Qualifications -An earned Doctorate Degree in related discipline; -Bilingual teaching ability preferred; -Proven university teaching experience in related disciplines and strong experience in research records (with overseas experiences would be an advantage). Remuneration Package Remuneration and appointment rank offered will be commensurate with the successful applicants’ academic qualification, professional experience and current position. Medical benefits, annual leave, provident fund, allowance and bonus, on job training program or overseas study opportunities will be provided by the University. Application Procedure Applicants should submit an online application and attach documents as required. 立即申請 科大概況 澳門科技大學建校於 2000 年，發展迅速，已成為澳門在校學生規模最大的綜合型大學。位列英國《泰晤士高等教育》世界排名 300 強及世界年輕大學排名 38 位（ 2024 年）。大學致力為社會培養各類高質素人才，推行教研並重政策，注重辦學特色，追求卓越。澳門科技大學成為了澳門第一所成功全面通過英國高等教育品質保障局（ Quality Assurance Agency for Higher Education ， QAA ）高等教育素質評鑒 - 院校認證（ Institutional Accreditation ）的高校。大學坐落澳門氹仔島，環境優美，交通便利，是學子求學及從事研究的理想之地。 經過多年建設，大學現有五個國家級研究平台：中藥機制與質量全國重點實驗室、月球與行星科學全國重點實驗室、中國歷史研究院澳門歷史研究中心、澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站和中國 - 葡萄牙人工智能與公共衛生問題「一帶一路」聯合實驗室。此外還建