    "https://careers.must.edu.mo/recruitment-latest-details?0=680&from=RecruitmentLatest": {
      "title": "Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor / Lecturer",
      "description": "Department: 商學院(MSB) Professor / Associate Professor / Assistant Professor / Lecturer 職位編碼 20260701008 招聘部門 商學院(MSB) 招聘地點 澳門_中國 招聘時間 2026/07/01 ~ 直至空缺被填補 職位描述 The School of Business (MSB) was established in 2000 and is the largest faculty in the University. Consistent with MSB’s mission to “(1) promote innovation and dissemination of knowledge in business and management, (2) nurture responsible business talents with international perspectives, and (3) contribute to the social and economic development of the local communities and the region”, the School has offered high quality undergraduate and postgraduate programs in most business disciplines. Many of these programs are accredited by professional organizations such as the ACCA, CPA Australia, CIMA and CILT (for BBA in Supply Chain Management). In July 2023, MSB earned AACSB (The Association to Advance Collegiate Schools of Business) International Accreditation and is positioned among the top 6% of business schools globally. According to the Times Higher Education (THE) World University Rankings by Subject 2023, the subject of “Business and Economics” of Macao University of Science and Technology is ranked in the range of 176-200. With diverse faculty members having degrees from top-tier universities around the world, the School keeps training students’ leadership and creativity, discovering students’ talent and potential, and integrating “business ethics, communication skills and globalization” into the curriculum, which will lead the School to be an innovative business school that is most dynamic and broadly influential in the region. To cope with our developmental plan, applications are invited from those with excellent academic achievements in the following areas: Professional Areas Fintech, Quantitative Finance, Accounting Analytics, Economics(Applied Economics, AI Economics, Digital Economics, Platform Economics), Marketing, Human Resource Management, Public Administration, Charity and Social Organization Management, International Trade, Intelligent Supply Chain Management, Business Intelligence and Data Analytics, and other relevant areas. Qualifications -An earned Doctorate Degree in related discipline; -Bilingual teaching ability preferred; -Proven university teaching experience in related disciplines and strong experience in research records (with overseas experiences would be an advantage). Remuneration Package Remuneration and appointment rank offered will be commensurate with the successful applicants’ academic qualification, professional experience and current position. Medical benefits, annual leave, provident fund, allowance and bonus, on job training program or overseas study opportunities will be provided by the University. Application Procedure Applicants should submit an online application and attach documents as required. 立即申請 科大概況 澳門科技大學建校於 2000 年，發展迅速，已成為澳門在校學生規模最大的綜合型大學。位列英國《泰晤士高等教育》世界排名 300 強及世界年輕大學排名 38 位（ 2024 年）。大學致力為社會培養各類高質素人才，推行教研並重政策，注重辦學特色，追求卓越。澳門科技大學成為了澳門第一所成功全面通過英國高等教育品質保障局（ Quality Assurance Agency for Higher Education ， QAA ）高等教育素質評鑒 - 院校認證（ Institutional Accreditation ）的高校。大學坐落澳門氹仔島，環境優美，交通便利，是學子求學及從事研究的理想之地。 經過多年建設，大學現有五個國家級研究平台：中藥機制與質量全國重點實驗室、月球與行星科學全國重點實驗室、中國歷史研究院澳門歷史研究中心、澳門海岸帶生態環境國家野外科學觀測研究站和中國 - 葡萄牙人工智能與公共衛生問題「一帶一路」聯合實驗室。此外還建立了二十多個重大的研究院所及研究中心，在多個領域開展了戰略性跨學科及前沿研究。 展望未來，澳門科技大學將繼續以教研為本，廣納賢才，實現辦學宗旨和教育使命。 Copyright © 2023-2026 澳門科技大學 版權所有 系統檢測到您已申請過此職位，不可再次投遞，請選擇其他職位進行申請 關閉"
